msgid "To use Zed's agent with Bedrock, set a custom authentication strategy in your settings or use static credentials. Mantle-only models (e.g. GPT-5.5, GPT-5.4, Grok 4.3) additionally require IAM permissions for the `bedrock-mantle` endpoint."
